<p>Fires out a bolt of cosmic energy in the target direction. The projectile continues until it hits a wall or the edge of the map, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> dark damage to enemies hit and restoring <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 8, 9, 10, 12</acronym> negative energy. The negative energy gained is reduced by 25% per enemy hit, restoring a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">24, 32, 36, 40, 48.</acronym> Enemies hit will become aware of you.</p>